  <jpcrp_cor:NotesSecuritiesFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6&gt;（有価証券関係）&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; text-align: left"&gt;１．子会社株式&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; line-height: 18px; text-align: left; text-indent: 12px"&gt;市場価格のない株式等の貸借対照表計上額&lt;/p&gt;
